  "description": "AXUDP transport for the Packet.NET stack: AxudpSocket, a bidirectional AX.25-over-IP (RFC 1226) endpoint that UDP-encapsulates AX.25 frames. It unconditionally appends + validates the 2-octet AX.25 FCS (CRC-16-CCITT) exactly as every real AXIP/AXUDP peer does (ax25ipd, LinBPQ BPQAXIP, XRouter), with a raw escape hatch for replaying captures. Source: github.com/packet-net/packet.net.",
